    "description": "Title:\nRock On 48 Ultimate Rockin Collection Mineral Specimens Set Guide Tray\nDepartment:\nCollectibles & Art\nCondition:\nUsed\nCategory:\nCollectibles & Art\nDescription:\nBring home an exciting educational experience with this 48-piece rock and mineral collection kit. The set includes an original display box, a blue plastic tray with 48 slots (a few may be missing stones), and a colorful fold-out poster with vivid images and information for each rock and mineral featured in the collection. Included are a variety of polished and raw stones, from classic rose quartz to unique textured specimens and a heart-shaped clear stone. The kit offers a wonderful visual and tactile variety for collectors, students, or those curious about geology. Each item is photographed to display its specific characteristics, while the included guide enhances learning and identification for each stone. The set as shown is in used condition with some stones potentially missing and visible wear to the packaging. Perfect for an educational gift, a hands-on science tool, or a starter set for amateur collectors",
